{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10130100","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10130100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1013010001:1":{"text":"실례했습니다. 여러분의 큰 도움에 다시금 감사드립니다.","source_cn":"失礼了，请允许我再次感谢诸位的鼎力协助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DCE254BE07B008C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013010002:2":{"text":"저희는 힘이 닿는 대로 도와드렸을 뿐이에요. 진정한 영웅은 <style=\"highlight\">성당의 기사</style>이신 여러분이죠!","source_cn":"我们只是尽力而为，真正的英雄是你们——大驾光临的圣堂骑士们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79F5DEC7C9FB180C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1013010002":{"text":"저희는 힘이 닿는 대로 도와드렸을 뿐이에요. 진정한 영웅은 <style=\"highlight\">성당의 기사</style>이신 여러분이죠!","source_cn":"我们只是尽力而为，真正的英雄是你们——大驾光临的圣堂骑士们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79F5DEC7C9FB180C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1013010003:2":{"text":"그냥 한번 해보고 싶었어요.","source_cn":"只是想说说看嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FE6254063282267","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013010005:1":{"text":"듀라신이시여, 저는 성당 소속 성기사로, 현재 소대 하나를 이끌고 성석 마을을 지나던 중이었습니다.","source_cn":"艾雅在上，我是隶属圣堂的圣骑士，目前带领一个小队途径圣石镇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA644C8D4048F995E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1013010006:1":{"text":"저는 부대장 루시우스라고 합니다. 성석 마을에 도착하자마자 골렘에게 습격을 당하는 바람에...","source_cn":"我是副队卢修斯，我们抵达圣石镇不久，恰好碰上魔偶来袭……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FF18FE2C6B6B6C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1013010007:1":{"text":"여러분께 말씀드릴 것이 있습니다. 현재 “골렘”이라고 불리우는 이 몬스터는...","source_cn":"请允许我告知各位，如今被称为“魔偶”的怪物——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x576470A5CBDC82F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1013010008:1":{"text":"여신, 그리고 성당과도 관련이 있으니, 골렘의 만행을 막는 건 저희가 책임지고 해야 하는 일입니다.","source_cn":"与女神和圣堂有关，阻止它们为祸人间，也是我们的责任所在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C741990EB4FB282","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1013010009:1":{"text":"“선의의 길은 심연으로 통한다.” 여러분의 여신이 자비를 좀 덜 베풀 수는 없었을까요?","source_cn":"“善意之路，通往深渊。”你们的女神，当初就不能少慈爱一点吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5AE17E7B36B549E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1013010010:2":{"text":"...당신의 믿음이 부족해도, 저는 손해 볼 것이 없습니다.","source_cn":"……你不够虔信，这并不是我的损失。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x931EAC984EA78ECB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"어딘가 익숙한 말인데...","source_cn":"真是耳熟……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x23C599EE6228B7B4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"어딘가 익숙한 말인데...","female":"어딘가 익숙한 말인데...","variant_male_record_index":"61696","variant_female_record_index":"61697","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1013010004:1":{"text":"갑옷을 입고 있어 예를 갖추기 쉽지 않네요. 저희의 이런 태도 때문에 오해하셨다면... 사과 드리겠습니다.","source_cn":"重甲在身，不便行礼。如果我们的态度引起误会……我道歉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E76170F484CEB35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:1:2":{"text":"아주 귀에 거슬려","source_cn":"真是刺耳","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB372182A5D1033BA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아주 귀에 거슬려","female":"아주 귀에 거슬려","variant_male_record_index":"61698","variant_female_record_index":"61699","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:特弥希娅":{"text":"테미히아","source":"特弥希娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢修斯":{"text":"루시우스","source":"卢修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":3}}